+	/// SDE: an image made by `bind_pixmap` is a copy of the pixmap's content at the
+	/// time it was bound, later drawing into the pixmap does not reach it
+	/// (GLX_EXT_texture_from_pixmap allows this; Mesa's software OpenGL does it).
+	/// The compositor binds the pixmap of a window again after the window was
+	/// damaged.
+	BACKEND_QUIRK_PIXMAP_SNAPSHOT = 1 << 1,
